# mosip-vivid integration-desktop patch -- generated against mosip/registration-client release-1.2.0.x (c1cc4e7f).
# Applies with git apply and compiles against the real client (see docs/testing/desktop-mosip-compile.md); never run.
# Application login with face (SessionContext.validateFace): optional FaceAuthLivenessGuard bean (implemented by
# io.mosip.vivid.desktop.mosip.OperatorAuthLivenessHook in registration-client) runs operator liveness before the auth
# capture and binds the capture after it. registration-services gets no compile-time dependency on mosip-vivid.
